---
title: 'Faye Wai — Multi-creative'
description: 'Faye Wai — artist, poet, and content strategist in Port Moody, BC. Abstract painting, pottery, the poetry chapbook fragments & echoes, and editorial work.'
ogTitle: 'Faye Wai — Multi-creative'
ogDescription: 'Artist, poet, and content strategist. Painting, poetry, pottery, and editorial work.'
---
{% from "work.njk" import tile %}
<main id="main">
<div class="wrap">

  <header class="hero grid grid--hero">
    <div>
      <div class="eyebrow-rule"><span class="eyebrow">Painting · Poetry · Pottery</span></div>
      <h1 class="display h1" style="max-width:16ch">Work made to feel, work made to be clear</h1>
      <p class="standfirst">I’m Faye — an artist and poet, and a content strategist by day. Two practices, one thread: paying close attention.</p>
      <div class="btns">
        <a class="btn btn--solid" href="art.html">Enter the studio</a>
        <a class="btn" href="poetry.html">Read the poems</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="frame frame--paper frame--contain sq"><img src="assets/chapbook-cover.jpg" alt="Cover artwork for fragments &amp; echoes" fetchpriority="high"></div>
  </header>

  <section class="doors" aria-label="Sections">
    <a class="door" href="art.html">
      <span class="num">01 / STUDIO</span>
      <h2 class="h3">Creative practice</h2>
      <p>Abstract painting, pottery, and movement — intuitive, layered, honest.</p>
    </a>
    <a class="door" href="poetry.html">
      <span class="num">02 / WORDS</span>
      <h2 class="h3">fragments &amp; echoes</h2>
      <p>A limited-release chapbook on heartbreak, home, and healing.</p>
    </a>
    <a class="door" href="editorial.html">
      <span class="num">03 / DESK</span>
      <h2 class="h3">Editorial portfolio</h2>
      <p>Strategy, thought leadership, and B2B storytelling for people-first brands.</p>
    </a>
  </section>

  {#- The three pieces marked `featured: true` in _data/gallery.js. -#}
  <section class="section section--rule" aria-labelledby="selected">
    <div class="section-head" data-reveal>
      <span class="eyebrow" id="selected">Selected work</span>
      <a class="arrow" href="art.html">All work →</a>
    </div>
    <div class="tiles" data-lightbox>
      {%- for w in gallery | featured %}
      {{ tile(w, true, 'offset' if loop.index0 == 1 else '', 'r34') }}
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section--tall section--rule grid grid--about" id="about" aria-labelledby="about-h">
    <div data-reveal>
      <span class="eyebrow">About</span>
      <div style="margin-top:24px"><div class="frame r34"><img src="assets/faye-portrait.jpg" alt="Faye Wai" loading="lazy" style="object-position:center 30%"></div></div>
    </div>
    <div data-reveal style="max-width:60ch">
      <h2 class="h2" id="about-h" style="max-width:26ch">A curious multi-creative, learning along the way</h2>
      <div class="prose" style="margin-top:clamp(22px,3vh,34px)">
        <p>I’m a content strategist and tech analyst who believes in meaningful work and the honest exploration of creativity. By day I work with editorial teams to create clear, search-friendly content that helps people grow their careers.</p>
        <p>Outside of work I paint abstract art, make pottery, and write poetry — ways of exploring the subtler things words alone can’t hold. My creative practice lives between logic and intuition, weaving memory, emotion, and embodiment into form.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="kv" style="margin-top:clamp(34px,5vh,56px)">
        <div class="kv__row"><span class="label">Listening</span><span>d4vd, Jorja Smith, lo-fi jazz</span></div>
        <div class="kv__row"><span class="label">Reading</span><span>The Courage to Be Disliked — Ichiro Kishimi</span></div>
        <div class="kv__row"><span class="label">Making</span><span>Layered, moody art with 3D texture</span></div>
        <div class="kv__row"><span class="label">Exploring</span><span>Somatics, and the softening of mind into body</span></div>
      </div>
      <a class="btn btn--md" href="about.html" style="margin-top:clamp(28px,4vh,40px)">More about Faye →</a>
    </div>
  </section>

</div>

<section class="panel" aria-labelledby="chapbook-h">
  <div class="panel__in grid grid--panel">
    <div data-reveal>
      <span class="eyebrow">Current project</span>
      <h2 class="display h2--big" id="chapbook-h">fragments<br><span class="i">&amp; echoes</span></h2>
      <p class="prose">A limited-release poetry chapbook exploring heartbreak, home, and healing across cities and life chapters.</p>
      <div class="btns">
        <a class="btn btn--solid" href="poetry.html">Read poems</a>
        <a class="btn" href="{{ chapbook.sample }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Sample artwork</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div data-reveal><div class="frame frame--blush frame--contain r34"><img src="assets/chapbook-cover-blush.jpg" alt="fragments &amp; echoes chapbook cover" loading="lazy"></div></div>
  </div>
</section>
</main>
